# CITATION.cff


cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "X4 Pro Lock Screen Converter"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Paiva"
    given-names: "Heleno"

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-26"

abstract: >
  A browser-based image converter designed to prepare custom lock-screen
  images for the Xteink X4 Pro. Images are resized to 480 × 800 pixels,
  converted to grayscale, processed using Floyd–Steinberg dithering,
  and exported as uncompressed 24-bit BMP files optimized for e-ink display.

keywords:
  - e-ink
  - Xteink
  - X4 Pro
  - dithering
  - Floyd-Steinberg
  - BMP
  - image processing
  - lock screen

license: MIT
```
